/T (Conclusion: Systematic experimentation showed that the CICFlowMeter PCAP pipeline is useful for generating training data but adds no value to dashboard inference. It also revealed that CIC-IDS2017 lacks a clean temporal holdout because attacks are concentrated by day. These are methodological findings, not failures.)
/E (Conclusion: Systematic experimentation showed that the CICFlowMeter PCAP pipeline is useful for generating training data but adds no value to dashboard inference. It also revealed that CIC-IDS2017 lacks a clean temporal holdout because attacks are concentrated by day. These are methodological findings, not failures.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
